<!-- ── Knowledge Section ── -->
<section id="knowledge" class="py-20 sm:py-28 border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="text-green text-sm font-mono mb-2">// knowledge</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-3">Conocimiento público</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted mb-10">
        Lo que aprendo, lo documento. Aquí tienes acceso directo a mis recursos técnicos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Pentest Notes -->
      <a href="https://m3m16.gitbook.io/pentest-notes" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="reveal glow-card block p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg border border-green/20 bg-surface-light group hover:bg-surface-light/80 transition-all">
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-green mb-4 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-text">Pentest Notes</h3>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono bg-green/10 text-green border border-green/30 rounded">
            Actualizado recientemente
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Base de conocimiento técnica en constante actualización.
          Notas detalladas sobre web pentesting, Active Directory, mobile y herramientas ofensivas.
          Cubre desde SSRF y SSTI hasta GraphQL attacks, API exploitation y LDAP injection.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          {['Web', 'AD', 'Mobile', 'Tools'].map((tag) => (
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-green/60">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <span class="text-sm text-green font-mono group-hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-transform">
          Abrir GitBook →
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- Write-ups HTB -->
      <a href="https://m3m16.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="reveal glow-card block p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg border border-green/20 bg-surface-light group hover:bg-surface-light/80 transition-all">
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-green mb-4 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-text mb-2">Write-ups HTB</h3>

        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Resoluciones detalladas de máquinas Hack The Box con metodología paso a paso.
          Linux, Windows, técnicas de escalada, explotación web y más. +10 máquinas documentadas.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          {['HTB', 'Linux', 'Windows', 'Web'].map((tag) => (
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-green/60">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <span class="text-sm text-green font-mono group-hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-transform">
          Ver write-ups →
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
